# Compiled binary
cairnlint

# The global gitignore excludes /.github/ and .golangci.yml, which silently
# dropped this repo's dependabot.yml, its auto-merge workflow, and its lint
# config: they existed on disk, were never committed, and so never reached
# GitHub. CI was running golangci-lint with stock defaults as a result.
# Re-including them here keeps the toolchain config under version control.
!/.github/
!.golangci.yml
